<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<catalogue id="5c7f-61ce-edd8-5cea" name="First Dynasty Babylonian" revision="4" battleScribeVersion="2.03" authorName="Jono Firth" authorUrl="https://www.greatescapegames.co.uk/uploads/images/wysiwyg/home-shortcuts/coe/chariot/First_Dynasty_Babylonian_June_1st_2012.pdf" library="false" gameSystemId="c749-87c2-0d4a-5e29" gameSystemRevision="12" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema">
  <readme>This army list covers the city-states of the Amorite kingdoms such as Babylon, moost notably the reign of Hammurabi (1792-1750) until its fall at the hands of the Hittite king Mursilis I. Historical enemies include Neo-Sumerians, Hittites, Hyksos and Mitanni.

A Babylonian army must include a general and at least two units of Shock Infantry.</readme>
